[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.display. AbstractDisplay, Display, DisplayDisabled, PaperDisplayMarker - Paper entity-backed shop displays.

[_conclusions]
Display system is Paper-specific and uses per-player visibility for smooth multiplayer experience without affecting other viewers.

[_summary]
Paper entity-backed shop display system. Creates shared and player-specific display entities using Paper's per-player visibility API.

[_does]
Manages display visibility per-player, creates floating text entities, handles tag lifecycle, provides no-op fallback when displays are disabled, marks display entities for cleanup safety.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
PaperDisplayMarker uses different key/data type from legacy `display: 1` cleanup marker to avoid deleting active Paper displays. Requires Paper API for per-player visibility.

